  "description": "The PUBLIC C7i will take you wherever you want to go—in comfort and style.\nAt the heart of what makes the C7i our standout Dutch-inspired low-step bike is the Shimano Nexus 7-speed internally geared rear hub. This durable, low-maintenance system delivers smooth, effortless shifting and allows you to change gears whether you’re pedaling or stopped at a light. Paired with a simplified drivetrain and our strongest double-walled rims, the C7i is built to provide years of reliable performance—even on rough local streets.\nThe classic Dutch commuter design has been popular across Europe for decades, thanks in large part to how easy it is to mount and dismount. The upright riding position offers comfort, confidence, and excellent visibility from the rider's perspective.\nLike all PUBLIC bikes, the C7i includes front and rear rack mounts, making it easy to add a rack for panniers or a basket. Many riders choose to further personalize their bike with a Brooks saddle and accessories from our thoughtfully curated selection.\nIn addition to the smooth-shifting Nexus hub, the C7i features powerful dual-pivot brakes for dependable stopping power and 3M reflective sidewall tires to enhance nighttime visibility.\nWe designed the PUBLIC C7i in response to riders who wanted a high-quality, stylish, internally geared city bike that delivers versatility and function at an accessible price. It’s one of our favorites—and we’re confident it will be yours, too.\nOrdering your new PUBLIC bike online is simple. We offer multiple shipping options, including delivery directly to your home or office. Our most popular choice is Ready to Ride shipping, where your bike arrives fully assembled—just install the pedals and adjust the handlebars (tools included), and you’re ready to roll.",
